OL,3,CProgramme listings for THU 18 DEC
OL,4,G1600FComposer of the Week: Prokofiev
OL,5,     GKate Molleson explores
OL,6,     GProkofiev's American dreams, a
OL,7,     Gfantastical opera, and a love
OL,8,     Gstory that changed his life.
OL,9,G1700FIn Tune
OL,10,     GPetroc Trelawny is joined in
OL,11,     Gstudio by pianist Isata Kanneh-
OL,12,     GMason. The BBC Singers perform
OL,13,     Gfestive repertoire live from
OL,14,     GMaida Vale, London.
OL,15,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,16,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,17,     Gsoundscape of classical music.
